    "The robot receives essential information about the incoming threat through sensory input.",
    "The sensory input allows the robot to infer the ball's trajectory.",
    "The robot determines which body links are at risk of contact based on sensory data.",
    "Quick processing of sensory information is vital for the robot to react within a fraction of a second.",
    "The robot must avoid being hit while maintaining balance.",
    "CBFs encode safety constraints to ensure the robot's movements remain collision-free.",
    "CBFs guide the robot's actions based on the perceived state of the environment.",
    "The PAC-MAN framework employs two levels of CBFs: Link-CBF and Joint-CBF.",
    "Link-CBF provides lightweight per-link rewards during training.",
    "Joint-CBF offers a comprehensive whole-body projection used during deployment.",
    "The choice between Link-CBF and Joint-CBF depends on the quality of sensory input.",
    "Joint-CBF performs best with accurate ball state information.",
    "Link-CBF is more suitable under limited perception conditions.",
    "An adversarial motion prior (AMP) serves as a regularizer in the system.",
    "AMP encourages the robot to adopt human-like evasive behaviors such as crouching and sidestepping.",
    "The combination of sensory feedback and CBFs enables coordinated, reflexive movements that are safe and effective.",
    "The collaboration between advanced sensory feedback and CBFs in the PAC-MAN framework allows humanoid robots to perform complex evasive maneuvers in dodgeball.",
    "The system balances rapid response with maintaining stability and safety."
] 

